{
  "_guide": {
    "standing": "A long slow stab with drag. If used with revealed (i.e. after attacks), becomes a very fast jab with very short drag for annoyance and followups",
    "falling": "jab down and drag the mob along with you, pinning and wetting them if they hit the ground with water splash particles.",
    "aerial": "sweep your hand across the screen and throw a web that slows and distracts enemies, no direct damage",
    "sprinting": "charge through with block frames leaving a trail of water that wets enemies",
    "guard counter": "push your trident out with no damage but parry frames. On parry, twist the trident and bind the mob, with a guardian one-two if possible at max spirit",
    "throw": "non-piercing embedding throw, spawns lightning at full spirit",
    "pickup": "spin the trident above your head, with two tropical fish circling around it, gaining some dodge frames.",
    "draw": "throw a net with some salmon trailing behind it that pins and confuses at max spirit"
  },
